{"t":"PEG","made":"2026-11-06 14:38","name":"Public Service Enterprise Group Incorporated","ko":null,"sector":"Utilities","industry":"Utilities - Regulated Electric","employees":13189,"hq":"Newark, NJ, United States","website":"https://investor.pseg.com","summary_en":"Public Service Enterprise Group Incorporated, through its subsidiaries, operates in electric and gas utility, and nuclear generation businesses in the United States. It operates through PSE&G and PSEG Power segments. The PSE&G segment transmits electricity; distributes electricity and natural gas to residential, commercial, and industrial customers; and appliance services and repairs to customers through its service territory, as well as invests in solar generation projects, and energy efficiency and related programs. The PSEG Power segment engages in nuclear generation businesses; and supplies power and natural gas to nuclear power plants. As of December 31, 2025, it had electric transmission and distribution system of 25,000 circuit miles and 871,000 poles; 58 switching stations with an installed capacity of 40,000 megavolt-amperes (MVA), and 238 substations with an installed capacity of 10,890 MVA; four electric distribution headquarters and five electric sub-headquarters; 18,000 miles of gas mains, 12 gas distribution headquarters, two sub-headquarters, and two meter shop, as well as 54 natural gas metering and regulating stations; and 158 MegaWatts defined conditions of installed PV solar capacity. The company was founded in 1903 and is based in Newark, New Jersey.","quote_type":"EQUITY","summary_ko":"Public Service Enterprise Group Incorporated는 자회사를 통해 미국에서 전기, 가스 유틸리티, 원자력 발전 사업을 운영하고 있습니다. PSE&G 및 PSEG Power 부문을 통해 운영됩니다. PSE&G 부문은 전기를 송전합니다. 주거용, 상업용, 산업용 고객에게 전기와 천연가스를 공급합니다. 서비스 영역을 통해 고객에게 가전제품 서비스 및 수리를 제공할 뿐만 아니라 태양광 발전 프로젝트, 에너지 효율성 및 관련 프로그램에 투자합니다. PSEG 전력 부문은 원자력 발전 사업에 종사하고 있습니다. 원자력 발전소에 전력과 천연가스를 공급합니다. 2025년 12월 31일 기준으로 25,000 회로 마일과 871,000극의 전기 송배전 시스템을 갖추고 있습니다. 40,000MVA(메가볼트 암페어)의 설치 용량을 갖춘 58개의 스위칭 스테이션과 10,890MVA의 설치 용량을 갖춘 238개의 변전소; 4개의 배전본부와 5개의 전기분본부; 18,000마일의 가스 본관, 12개의 가스 유통 본부, 2개의 하위 본부, 2개의 미터 매장, 54개의 천연가스 계량 및 조절 스테이션; 158 메가와트는 설치된 PV 태양광 용량의 조건을 정의했습니다. 이 회사는 1903년에 설립되었으며 뉴저지 주 뉴어크에 본사를 두고 있습니다.","val":{"price":73.1,"mcap":36441477120.0,"pe":20.649717,"fpe":15.737386,"peg":3.4603,"ps":2.9538362,"pb":2.0967789,"ev_ebitda":14.426,"div":3.67,"beta":0.491,"hi52":87.63,"lo52":66.15},"fin":{"rev":12337000448.0,"rev_g":-0.064,"eps_g":-0.391,"gross":0.32115,"op":0.21291,"net":0.14315,"roe":0.10276,"fcf":-324249984.0,"cash":837000000.0,"debt":25764999168.0,"de":148.399,"eps":3.54,"feps":4.64499},"own":{"short":0.020399999,"inst":0.79291,"insider":0.00127},"analyst":{"n":19,"mean":81.31579,"median":80.0,"high":96.0,"low":69.0,"rec":"buy","recMean":2.34783,"trend":[{"index":0,"period":"0m","strongBuy":1,"buy":7,"hold":15,"sell":0,"strongSell":0},{"index":1,"period":"-1m","strongBuy":1,"buy":7,"hold":15,"sell":0,"strongSell":0},{"index":2,"period":"-2m","strongBuy":2,"buy":7,"hold":13,"sell":0,"strongSell":0},{"index":3,"period":"-3m","strongBuy":1,"buy":7,"hold":14,"sell":0,"strongSell":0}]},"changes":[{"GradeDate":"2026-11-03","Firm":"Ladenburg Thalmann","ToGrade":"Neutral","FromGrade":"Neutral","Action":"main","priceTargetAction":"Lowers","currentPriceTarget":75.5,"priorPriceTarget":80.5},{"GradeDate":"2026-11-03","Firm":"Wells Fargo","ToGrade":"Overweight","FromGrade":"Overweight","Action":"main","priceTargetAction":"Lowers","currentPriceTarget":87.0,"priorPriceTarget":89.0},{"GradeDate":"2026-10-27","Firm":"B of A Securities","ToGrade":"Buy","FromGrade":"Buy","Action":"main","priceTargetAction":"Lowers","currentPriceTarget":85.0,"priorPriceTarget":87.0},{"GradeDate":"2026-10-22","Firm":"HSBC","ToGrade":"Hold","FromGrade":"","Action":"init","priceTargetAction":"Announces","currentPriceTarget":72.5,"priorPriceTarget":0.0},{"GradeDate":"2026-10-21","Firm":"Morgan Stanley","ToGrade":"Overweight","FromGrade":"Overweight","Action